Zainb E Hazeen E Maan Khwahara Khuda Hafiz<br>
<br>
Aye Be Gham Kharine Maan Khwahara Khuda Hafiz<br>
<br>
1. Maan Ke Be Alamdaram, Be Moein O Beyaraam<br>
<br>
Az Haayat E Be Zaaram, Khwahara Khuda....<br>
<br>
2. Mausam E Judayi Shud, Wadaye Khudayi Shud<br>
<br>
Roz E Be Nawayi Shud, Khwahara Khuda....<br>
<br>
3. Baad E Qasim O Akber, Man Naa Daraam Aaye Khwaher<br>
<br>
Meel E Zindagi Deegar, Khwahara Khuda....<br>
<br>
4. Kufa E Qarab Az Tu, Naal'ae Rabab Az Tu<br>
<br>
Majlis E Shahrab Az Tu, Khwahara Khuda